DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Material Vacuum
DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Visibility 0
DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Position 0 0 46.596
DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Rotation 0 180 180
DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Virtual True
DetectorQ0L0Wrapper.Mother DetectorStackWrapper

Include HolderGeDQ0L0.geo

# Q0L0 Detector

Include GeDQ0L0.Inactive.geo
